## 📌 Overview

**AI SaaS** is a full-stack AI-powered SaaS web application that bundles multiple AI tools into a single platform. Users can generate **articles**, **blog titles**, and **AI images**, perform advanced **image transformations** (background removal, object removal) powered by **Cloudinary AI**, and get intelligent **resume analysis** — all behind a secure, seamless **Clerk OAuth** authentication system.

---

## ✨ Features

### 📝 Content Generation
| Tool | Description |
|---|---|
| ✍️ **Article Generator** | Generate full-length AI-written articles on any topic |
| 💡 **Blog Title Generator** | Get catchy, SEO-friendly blog title suggestions |
| 🖼️ **AI Image Generator** | Create unique images from text prompts using AI |

### 🖼️ Image Transformation (Cloudinary AI)
| Tool | Description |
|---|---|
| 🪄 **Background Remover** | Instantly remove background from any image |
| 🧹 **Object Remover** | Erase unwanted objects from images with AI |

### 📄 Resume Analyzer
- Upload your resume and get **AI-powered feedback**
- Identifies **strengths**, **weaknesses**, and **improvement areas**
- Suggests **missing keywords** for target job roles
- Provides an overall **resume score**

### 🔐 Authentication
- **Clerk OAuth** — Sign in with Google, GitHub, and more
- Secure, session-managed user accounts
- User-specific history and usage tracking

